b9366f411b.jpg", "url": "/fondos-de-pantalla/storm-samurai-standoff-daef3eb9366f411b.html"}, {"alt": "Instrumento cient\u00edfico vintage de lat\u00f3n sobre escritorio de madera con papeles escritos a mano.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/antique-spectrometer-study-2ef0107fd8f7bce0.jpg", "url": "/fondos-de-pantalla/estudio-de-espectrometro-antiguo-2ef0107fd8f7bce0.html"}, {"alt": "Una constelaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica moldeada por galaxias brillantes y nebulosas en vibrantes tonos p\u00farpura, azul y rosa.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/cosmic-pi-galaxy-230f44ccb204491f.jpg", "url": "/fondos-de-pantalla/galaxia-pi-cosmica-230f44ccb204491f.html"}, {"alt": "Una brillante explosi\u00f3n c\u00f3smica que irradia a trav\u00e9s de coloridas nebulosas en el espacio profundo.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/galactic-shockwave-blaze-ef6fa15543ca1d76.jpg", "url": "/fondos-de-pantalla/onda-de-choque-galactica-llama-ef6fa15543ca1d76.html"}, {"alt": "Param\u00e9dico atendiendo a un paciente en una ambulancia con equipo m\u00e9dico.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/inside-emergency-care-5b86bb0bc8b68e09.jpg", "url": "/fondos-de-pantalla/dentro-de-la-atencion-de-emergencia-5b86bb0bc8b68e09.html"}, {"alt": "Nota adhesiva azul fijada a corcho con chincheta roja.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/blue-note-red-pin-31c011f36bb04d25.jpg", "url": "/fondos-de-pantalla/nota-azul-alfiler-rojo-31c011f36bb04d25.html"}, {"alt": "Un CD brillante que refleja colores de arco\u00edris sobre una superficie negra.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/rainbow-on-the-disc-8db345a2173c7114.jpg", "url": "/fondos-de-pantalla/arcoiris-en-el-disco-8db345a2173c7114.html"}, {"alt": "Veh\u00edculo todoterreno naranja conduciendo a trav\u00e9s de un charco de barro en el bosque.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/mud-splash-adventure-ef4b3c7b3bc72216.jpg"