         and we forward to the card's primary CTA. JS at the end of the
         page reads the CTA href + navigates. The card stays focusable
         from the keyboard via the CTA button itself (no double-tab). */
      .plan-card { cursor: pointer; }
      .plan-card .plan-cta { pointer-events: auto; }  /* still works */
